<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten prices unchanged in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten prices unchanged in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed and meal prices were unchanged Wednesday in lackluster trading, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's really quiet,&quot; a dealer said. &quot;We just haven't seen a lot of activity.</p>
<p>   CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq.	unq.</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  100.00    100.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   96.00     96.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  325.00    325.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
